---
---
<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-[#FAF6F0] border-t border-stone-200/60">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#EE4223] mb-3">Our Core Ingredients</h2>
      <p class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-stone-900 leading-tight">
        Joyful tools for building connection.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white/60 border border-stone-200/80 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-white transition-colors">
        <div>
          <span class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-400 block mb-6">01</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-900 mb-4">Music & Sound</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-light text-pretty">
            Rooted in our <span class="font-medium text-stone-800">Suena Bien</span> sound system heritage, we build speakers and curate uplifting music that gets children dancing and elders reminiscing. High fidelity, positive vibes, built for shared joy.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-500 text-sm font-medium">
          <span>🔊 Hand-built speakers & selectors</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white/60 border border-stone-200/80 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-white transition-colors">
        <div>
          <span class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-400 block mb-6">02</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-900 mb-4">Food & Feasts</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-light text-pretty">
            Food brings people to the table. We cook large, wholesome, delicious meals for community gatherings, fundraisers, and parties—offering warmth and hospitality without barriers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-500 text-sm font-medium">
          <span>🍲 Nourishing shared meals</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white/60 border border-stone-200/80 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-white transition-colors">
        <div>
          <span class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-400 block mb-6">03</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-900 mb-4">Bonfires & Bubbles</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-light text-pretty">
            We design environments that spark wonder. Whether it's clouds of bubbles filling a school yard or a warm bonfire gathering as evening falls, we build gentle rituals for play and connection.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-500 text-sm font-medium">
          <span>🔥 Magic for all ages</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
